module change-cofc-general-order-2025-02.closures

// A general order is court-scoped (docs/litigate/CHANGE.md §2.4): here it
// closes the court for one day, which RCFC 6 then treats as a legal
// holiday.

/// The day COFC General Order No. 2025-02 closes the court and treats as a
/// legal holiday for RCFC 6(a)(6). The RCFC 6 counting rule of `lit/core`
/// does not read this calendar yet (lg-fq2.6): the order is recorded, not
/// applied.
calendar cofc-closures cite "COFC General Order 2025-02"
{
  closed-2025-11-28: once(2025-11-28) effective [2025-11-28, ..)
}
